# Emoji allowlist

Do **not** use emojis in skills, commands, code, or UI text except:

| Glyph | Use |
|-------|-----|
| `⚠️` | Warning |
| `✅` | Success / green check |
| `❌` | Error / red X |
| `🔐` | Security / lock (HITL trigger chips) |
| `✕` | Close / dismiss |
| `✓` | Check / confirm |

Everything else: plain text, CSS icons, or semantic HTML. Remove disallowed emojis when encountered.

**Not emojis (OK in UI):** `→ ← ↑ ↓` and box-drawing `│ ├ └ ─ ┌ ┐ ┘ ┬ ┤`.

